lo costringe a ricadere nella delinquenza. Quando Sam decide di interrompere tutto, Narong attacca la sua famiglia. Sam attraverserà la Thailandia per vendicarsi del suo carnefice."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Mayhem!","overview":"Sam is a professional boxer about to get released from prison. While on parole, his past catches up with him and he has no choice but to flee. Five years later, he has rebuilt a simple life on an exotic island in Thailand with his wife and her daughter, but when he gets blackmailed by a dangerous local godfather, he must embark on a dangerous drug smuggling mission which results in a tragedy. Now he has only one purpose: to seek merciless vengeance.","tagline":"This ends one way."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Sam, un détenu sans problème, se retrouve malgré lui mêlé à une rixe qui se termine mal lors de sa première sortie conditionnelle : son seul salut : la fuite ! 5 ans plus tard, il cherche à acheter un terrain pour finaliser sa nouvelle vie : femme, enfant, travail, tout lui sourit, mais lors de l'achat, à la dernière minute, il apprend que le terrain n'est plus disponible. Il finit par rencontrer le mystérieux acheteur, qui n'est autre que Narong, le parrain local, qui lui fait une offre..."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/asUBBPvil6L6A2uXpwdKmA7f21r.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5PzdDQRUhuh32NoztAC2NZarvR3.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":959092,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u9035lysUz3ccloQt0SeIp1Mu8a.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u9035lysUz3ccloQt0SeIp1Mu8a.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u9035l